OL,3,GNEWSA'Lucky' no-one killed by murderous
OL,4,AGP poison plot                         
OL,6,FProsecutors say it was "lucky" no-one  
OL,7,Fwas killed by a murderous GP's attempt 
OL,8,Fto fatally poison his mother's partner 
OL,9,Fin a row over a will.                  
OL,11,FThomas Kwan, 55, sent Patrick O'Hara   
OL,12,Fbottles of alcohol laced with thallium,
OL,13,Fbut when that failed to kill him he    
OL,14,Fwent in disguise to the victim's       
OL,15,FNewcastle home and injected him with a 
OL,16,Ftoxin under the pretext of giving a    
OL,17,FCovid jab.                             
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
