OL,3,GNEWSA'Lucky' no-one killed by murderous
OL,4,AGP poison plot                         
OL,6,FKwan, who lived in Ingleby Barwick and 
OL,7,Fworked in Sunderland, was jailed for   
OL,8,Fmore than 31 years for the injection   
OL,9,Fmurder attempt and will be sentenced   
OL,10,Fnext year for the bottle poisonings    
OL,11,Fafter he lost his bid to withdraw his  
OL,12,Fguilty plea.                           
OL,14,FChris Atkinson of the Crown Prosecution
OL,15,FService (CPS) said he had never known a
OL,16,Fcase like it.                          
